ounty&rsquo;s 5 grids runs 75 years, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 48% of normal in August to September and 37% in November to December. So far in 2026, June to July came in at 162% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, with grid 20267 at 58% of normal that year.</p>"}
